{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Another Series on a Realized One, Etc.","html":"<article id='sn46.143-152'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.143–152 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 46.143–152 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>15. Punaappamādavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>15. Another Chapter on Diligence </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Punatathāgatādisutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Another Series on a Realized One, Etc. </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>…pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Pannarasamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Uddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tathāgataṁ padaṁ kūṭaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mūlaṁ sārena vassikaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Rājā candimasūriyā ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vatthena dasamaṁ padanti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='expansion-instructions'><span class='root'>(Appamādavaggo rāgavasena vitthāretabbo.) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>(Tell in full as in SN 45.139–148, removal of greed version.) </span></p></article>"}
